    "sections": {
        "description": "Pressline News is a modern editorial block theme for bloggers, writers and independent magazines. Elegant serif headlines paired with a clean sans-serif body, a warm paper palette and generous whitespace put your stories first. The homepage opens with a bold masthead, a large featured story card and a responsive grid of the latest posts, followed by topic cards and a newsletter call to action. Single posts feature a centered header, wide featured image, comfortable reading width, author box and related stories. Built entirely with core WordPress blocks and full site editing, every color, font, template and pattern can be customized from the Site Editor. Includes ready-made patterns, light and dark style variations, and a fully responsive, accessible layout."
    },
